1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,839
Many of the chart's tools are also signals.

2
00:00:02,889 --> 00:00:07,967
Chart shapes, Sonar markers, fair value gaps, anchored VWAP and the volume profile.

3
00:00:08,017 --> 00:00:11,261
So you can scan for them, build funnels from them, and test them.

4
00:00:11,724 --> 00:00:13,539
Open Signal Sets.

5
00:00:13,589 --> 00:00:17,310
The new family, Levels made by trading, holds fair value gaps,

6
00:00:17,330 --> 00:00:19,862
anchored VWAP and the volume profile.

7
00:00:19,912 --> 00:00:23,241
Chart shapes and Sonar markers have their own families.

8
00:00:23,694 --> 00:00:27,066
Pick the signal on the card, and the candle size it reads.

9
00:00:27,116 --> 00:00:30,131
Each one has settings too, such as where the VWAP starts:

10
00:00:30,151 --> 00:00:34,072
the last swing low or high, or the start of the week, month or year.

11
00:00:34,526 --> 00:00:38,431
We'll add fair value gaps and anchored VWAP, on four-hour candles.

12
00:00:41,811 --> 00:00:43,327
Now the lines.

13
00:00:43,377 --> 00:00:48,306
An up gap was tested in the last three candles: price dipped into a gap and held.

14
00:00:48,356 --> 00:00:51,430
And the close is above the VWAP from the last swing low.

15
00:00:57,246 --> 00:00:59,359
Chart shapes work the same way.

16
00:00:59,409 --> 00:01:03,413
A double bottom confirmed, or a golden cross in the last five candles,

17
00:01:03,433 --> 00:01:05,171
can be a line in any Set.

18
00:01:05,628 --> 00:01:07,357
Name it, and save it.

19
00:01:13,387 --> 00:01:17,069
Now scan your assets with it in Prism, use it as a funnel stage,

20
00:01:17,089 --> 00:01:19,703
or show it as colour bands on the chart.

21
00:01:19,753 --> 00:01:24,000
And Soundings checks these readings too, on years the search never saw.
